        "original_id": "3cefebc9-63ed-5ead-bcc5-bb43322aa5d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Phelps, Klete Keller, Ryan Lochte, Peter Vanderkaay, Young Jeezy, Detail, Akon, Ray J, Lil Wayne, Beyoncé, Wiz Khalifa\n- Events: Athens games\n- Songs: \"I'm So Paid\", \"Sexy Can I\", \"How to Love\", \"Drunk in Love\", \"711\", \"We Dem Boyz\"\n- Topics: Olympic swimming, music references, record production\n\nFacts:\n- Since the Athens games, the American relay team of Michael Phelps, Ryan Lochte, Peter Vanderkaay, and Klete Keller has remained undefeated.\n- Michael Phelps was born on June 30, 1985.\n- Michael Phelps is an American former competitive swimmer.\n- Michael Phelps is the most decorated Olympian of all time with 28 medals.\n- Young Jeezy's verse in \"I'm So Paid\" references fellow Olympian Michael Phelps.\n- Detail is known for producing hit singles including \"Sexy Can I\" by Ray J, \"I'm So Paid\" by Akon, \"How to Love\" by Lil Wayne, \"Drunk in Love\" and \"711\" by Beyoncé, and \"We Dem Boyz\" by Wiz Khalifa.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "bbdaec21-942d-5147-9217-25b36163a201",
        "text": "Page: Klete Keller. Sentence: The American relay of Michael Phelps, Ryan Lochte, Peter Vanderkaay, and Keller are undefeated since the Athens games.\nPage: Michael Phelps. Sentence: Michael Fred Phelps II (born June 30, 1985) is an American former competitive swimmer and the most decorated Olympian of all time, with a total of 28 medals.\nPage: I'm So Paid. Sentence: Fellow Olympian Michael Phelps is referenced in Young Jeezy's verse.\nPage: Detail (record producer). Sentence: He is perhaps best known for producing several hit singles, including \"Sexy Can I\" by Ray J, \"I'm So Paid\" by Akon, \"How to Love\" by Lil Wayne, \"Drunk in Love\" and \"711\" by Beyoncé, \"We Dem Boyz\" by Wiz Khalifa.",
